{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2023-05-23 17:40:00', 'title': 'AMEREN ILLINOIS ANNOUNCES PRICING OF FIRST MORTGAGE BONDS DUE 2033', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMEREN ILLINOIS COMPANY, A SUBSIDIARY OF AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE), ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF A PUBLIC OFFERING OF $500 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 4.95% FIRST MORTGAGE BONDS DUE 2033 AT 99.696% OF THEIR PRINCIPAL AMOUNT.\xa0 THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON MAY 31, 2023, SUBJECT TO THE SATISFACTION OF CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}